sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant TX as transaction screen
  participant M as domain/money.ts
  participant P as AppProvider/Repo
  participant DB as Supabase (RLS)
  participant H as Home (FR-2)
  U->>TX: Enter ฿85 · Food · date
  TX->>M: parseBahtToSatang("85")
  M-->>TX: 8500 satang (checks > 0, ≤ 2 decimals)
  U->>TX: Tap Save
  TX->>P: addTransaction(...)
  P->>DB: insert transactions (status = confirmed)
  DB-->>P: new row (visible to owner only)
  P-->>H: transactions changed
  H->>H: computeBalance + summarizeRange<br/>balance, income, expenses, category totals
  Note over U,H: Edit/delete: confirm first, Undo available → every total updates once
